node_modules/

# style.css and assets/dist/ are BUILT from assets/src/ by webpack. They are
# committed on purpose: WordPress reads the theme's name and version out of
# style.css, so a checkout without it is not a theme at all, and a server that
# deploys by pulling the repo has no Node on it.

# acf-json/ is COMMITTED. It is where the field groups live — ACF loads them
# from here by default, lists them in the admin, and writes any edit back to
# these files. A checkout without them is a site with no editing screens.
